    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、【2024年武汉工程大学2.2】 $f(t)=e^{-t}\\delta(t)$ ，其导数 $\\frac{df(t)}{dt}$ 为\\_\\_\\_\\_，积分 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}f(\\tau)d\\tau$ 为\\_\\_\\_\\_。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            110,
            811,
            169
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $f(t) = e^{-t} \\delta (t) = \\delta (t)$",
        "bbox": [
            196,
            190,
            478,
            233
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 $\\frac{d f(t)}{dt} = \\delta'(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            253,
            235,
            421,
            277
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f (\\tau) d \\tau = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} \\sqrt {\\tau} d \\tau = u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            282,
            295,
            579,
            336
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
