    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、【2024年宁波大学1】计算",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            108,
            430,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\sin \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6} t\\right) \\delta \\left(\\frac{t}{3} + 1\\right) dt$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            131,
            426,
            157
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\cos \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6} t\\right)\\delta '(t - 1)dt$",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            163,
            423,
            188
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: (1) $\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{t}{3}+1\\right)} = 3\\sqrt{(t+3)}$",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            205,
            529,
            241
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{故原式}} & {= \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{6} t) \\cdot 3 (\\sqrt {t + 3}) d t} \\\\ & {= 3 \\cdot \\sin [ \\frac {\\pi}{6} \\cdot (- 3) ]} \\\\ & {= 3 \\sin (- \\frac {\\pi}{2})} \\\\ & {= - 3} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            250,
            245,
            605,
            422
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{原式}} & {= - \\left[ \\cos (\\frac {\\pi}{6} t) \\right] _ {t = 1} ^ {\\prime}} \\\\ & {= - \\left[ - \\frac {\\pi}{6} \\sin (\\frac {\\pi}{6} t) \\right] _ {t = 1}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {\\pi}{6} \\sin \\frac {\\pi}{6}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {\\pi}{1 2}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            660,
            192,
            902,
            409
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
