    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4、【2024年重庆大学2】填空题",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            443,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $u\\left( t\\right)$ 的奇分量 $=$ \\_\\_\\_\\_.",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            133,
            401,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $\\delta(sint) =$",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            156,
            357,
            175
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/24c53c4be10b9e83ffddcf726fb7388891bcc9dd4cab4ccab2ca1491be950eb0.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            442,
            119,
            568,
            199
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} e^{-j\\omega t} \\delta'(t) dt =$",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            180,
            421,
            201
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解：(1) $f_{0}|t|=\\frac{u|t|-u|-t|}{2}$ 从同称为有 $\\frac{1}{2}\\sin u|t|$",
        "bbox": [
            161,
            205,
            660,
            260
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $\\sin t = 0$ 的根为 $t = k\\pi$ , $k = 0, \\pm1, \\pm2 \\cdots$",
        "bbox": [
            210,
            273,
            689,
            307
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(\\sin t) ^ {\\prime} = \\cos t\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            260,
            315,
            401,
            353
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{原式}} & {= \\sum \\frac {1}{| \\cos k \\pi |} \\delta (t - k \\pi)} \\\\ & {= \\sum \\delta (t - k \\pi), k = 0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2 \\dots} \\\\ & {= \\dots + \\delta (t + \\pi) + \\delta (t) + \\delta (t - \\pi) + \\delta (t - 2 \\pi) + \\dots} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            270,
            361,
            702,
            505
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 原式 = $-\\left[e^{-j\\omega t}\\right]_{t=0}^{1}$ = $-\\left[-j\\omega e^{-j\\omega t}\\right]_{t=0}$ = jW",
        "bbox": [
            200,
            511,
            759,
            560
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
