    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5、【2024年湖北工业大学1】已知 $x(4+2t)=\\delta(t)+e^{-2t-4}$ ，求：（关注通信考研小马哥，通信考研不迷路）",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            810,
            149
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $x(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            157,
            275,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 求 $\\int_{0}^{\\infty} x(t) dt$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            182,
            334,
            201
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解：(1) 法一：数学强",
        "bbox": [
            179,
            212,
            425,
            255
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "令 \\( a = 4 + {2t} \\) ,则 \\( t = \\( \\frac{a - 4}{2} \\)",
        "bbox": [
            210,
            252,
            470,
            292
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nx (a) = \\sqrt {(\\frac {a - 4}{2})} + e ^ {- a}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            293,
            428,
            328
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "即 $x(t) = \\delta(\\frac{t}{2} - 2) + e^{-t}$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            334,
            450,
            374
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "第三：运算视角",
        "bbox": [
            546,
            207,
            754,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {x (4 + x t)} & {\\xrightarrow {t \\to \\frac {t}{2}} x (4 + 2 \\cdot \\frac {t}{2})} \\\\ & {\\longrightarrow = x (4 + t)} \\\\ & {\\stackrel {1 1} {\\delta (\\frac {t}{2}) + e ^ {- t - 4}}} \\\\ & {= 2 \\delta (t) + e ^ {- t - 4}} \\end{array} \\quad \\begin{array}{r l} {t \\to t - 4} & {= x [ 4 + (t - 4 ]} \\\\ & {= x (t)} \\\\ & {\\downarrow} \\\\ & {\\longrightarrow 2 \\delta (t - 4) e ^ {- t}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            549,
            239,
            931,
            359
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nx (t) = 2 \\sqrt {(t - 4)} + e ^ {- t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            200,
            384,
            460,
            418
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {(2)} & {\\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} x (t) d t = 2 \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t - 4) d t + \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} e ^ {- t} d t} \\\\ & {\\qquad = 2 + [ - e ^ {- t} ] _ {0} ^ {\\infty}} \\\\ & {\\qquad = 2 + [ 0 + 1 ]} \\\\ & {\\qquad = 3} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            200,
            438,
            650,
            616
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
